{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34397","headline":"奉和夏初袭美见访题小斋次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和夏初袭美见访题小斋次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四邻多是老农家，百树鸡桑半顷麻。\n尽趁[晴]明修网架，每和烟雨掉缲车。\n啼鸾偶坐身藏叶，饷妇归来鬓有花。\n不是对君吟复醉，更将何事送年华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}